# Modified Stieltjes Transform and Generalized Convolutions

**Authors:** Lev B Klebanov, Rasool Roozegar

## Summary
Classical Stieltjes Transform is modified in a way to generalize both Stieltjes and Fourier transforms. This transform allows to intro- duce new classes of commutative and non-commutative generalized convolutions. Key words: Stieltjes Transform; characteristic function; generalized convolution.


